openrar (1.53.0-0ubuntu1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial Launchpad / Debian package release for v1.53.0.
  * Multi-binary package split: openrar (CLI), libopenrar1 (shared library),
    libopenrar-dev (headers, pkg-config, CMake exports).
  * Debian-compliant openrar(1) manual page.
  * Pkg-config openrar.pc metadata installation.
  * Hardening flags (+all) and multi-arch support.

